"PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 39 of them. In 2025, on that same middle, August to September came in at 43% of normal and November to December at 40%. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 63% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 23311 had its driest year in 1965 at 71% of normal.</p>"}
